{"packageRef":{"id":"content.c.p05","version":"1.0.0"},"subject":{"id":"exercise.c.grid-count","version":"1.0.0","title":"嵌套循环逐格计数","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"lessonRef":{"id":"lesson.c.nested-loops","version":"1.0.0"},"learningRevision":1,"acceptedPriorVersions":[],"knowledgeRefs":[{"id":"knowledge.c.loops","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"knowledge.c.variables","version":"1.0.0"}],"programRef":{"id":"program.c.practice-grid-count","version":"1.0.0"},"judgeRef":{"id":"judge.c.grid-count","version":"1.0.0"},"prompt":"rows、cols各为0到10。任意一项为0都没有网格贡献，结果0。可以使用for或while，但内层必须实际嵌套并逐格加1，不能做完无关循环后用乘法覆盖。\n\n教学目标：内层循环位于外层体，每个真实网格位置给同一计数器贡献1。\n\n所有测试都须正常结束且main返回0。必须让当前真实执行的数据与控制过程满足目标，不能用固定答案、死读取或未执行结构代替。","tests":[{"caseKey":"empty-rows","input":{"rows":0,"cols":5},"expectedStdout":"0\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"empty-cols","input":{"rows":5,"cols":0},"expectedStdout":"0\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"one","input":{"rows":1,"cols":1},"expectedStdout":"1\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"normal","input":{"rows":3,"cols":4},"expectedStdout":"12\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"maximum","input":{"rows":10,"cols":10},"expectedStdout":"100\n","expectedExitCode":0}],"rewardRef":{"id":"reward.exercise.first-pass","version":"1.0.0"}},"program":{"id":"program.c.practice-grid-count","version":"1.0.0","title":"嵌套循环逐格计数参考","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"subsetRef":{"id":"subset.c.p0","version":"1.0.0"},"inputRef":{"id":"input.c.grid-count","version":"1.0.0"},"exampleInput":{"rows":3,"cols":4},"sourceExample":"#include <stdio.h>\nint main(void) {\n    int rows = 3;\n    int cols = 4;\n    int count = 0;\n    for (int row = 0; row < rows; row = row + 1) {\n        for (int col = 0; col < cols; col = col + 1) {\n            count = count + 1;\n        }\n    }\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", count);\n    return 0;\n}\n","bindings":[{"bindingKey":"param.rows","inputKey":"rows","targetName":"rows","targetKind":"scalar","from":"field"},{"bindingKey":"param.cols","inputKey":"cols","targetName":"cols","targetKind":"scalar","from":"field"}],"blockRefs":[{"id":"block.c.main","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.integer","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.declare-int","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.read-variable","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.assign-variable","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.unary","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.printf","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.return","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.for","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.comparison","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.arithmetic","version":"1.0.0"}],"reference":{"document":"项目文档/验收/P0.5-09-正文审校.md","locator":"05.04；项目原创；受P0-C约束"}},"inputSpec":{"id":"input.c.grid-count","version":"1.0.0","title":"嵌套循环逐格计数输入","fields":[{"key":"rows","kind":"integer","min":0,"max":10},{"key":"cols","kind":"integer","min":0,"max":10}],"relations":[]},"judgeProfile":{"id":"judge.c.grid-count","version":"1.0.0","title":"嵌套循环逐格计数教学检查","rule":"nested-grid-count","targetDescription":"内层循环位于外层体，每个真实网格位置给同一计数器贡献1。"}}